      "id": "claim_636cab7b3ded434ab7087de63651a813",
      "statement": "The FastAPI application pins a single event loop before worker construction, installs ThreadRouter ahead of core thread/run routes, configures credentialed CORS from DASHBOARD_ALLOWED_ORIGINS while rejecting `*`, and composes product routers, the Agent API route, optional MCP, and dashboard UI.",
